stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading
    Loading --> Readable: Valid invoice snapshot
    Loading --> Unavailable: Impossible payment chronology
    Loading --> Unavailable: Read fails
    Readable --> Retained: Impossible chronology or read fails
    Retained --> Readable: Retry returns valid snapshot
    Unavailable --> Readable: Retry returns valid snapshot
    Readable --> Readable: Genuine same-day or ordinary invoice refresh
    Unavailable: Invoices unavailable and refresh available
    Readable: Verified invoices and owned deal navigation
    Retained: Prior verified invoices with unavailable notice
    %% never show impossible chronology as zero days to payment
    %% never enable payment from a rejected snapshot
